  "html": "<table align=\"right\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:left; background:rgb(240,240,240); border:1px solid black; width:25%;\">\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center; background:#9999FF; font-size:150%;\"> Soul Rend\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Soul-rend.png\" title=\"Image:Soul-rend.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Soul-rend.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Soul-rend.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Skill Type: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Trainer: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Fighter\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Number of Ranks: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>Cost to Max: </b>\n</td><td style=\"width:50%;\">Unknown\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\"><hr/>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\">Weapon infused with Divine Damage over time\n</td></tr></table>\n<p>Your weapon becomes infused with divine energy that rends your target's soul for Divine Damage over time.<br/>\nThis skill requires a melee weapon.\n</p><p><b>Cool down:</b> weapon based.\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><b>X Divine Damage over 3 seconds.</b><br/>* Damage listed is at INT = 10 for comparison purposes.  Damage increase is 1.5 damage points / point of Intellect.\n</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"text-align:center; width:100%; background:rgb(240,240,240);\">\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">1\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">2\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">3\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">4\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">5\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">6\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">7\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">8\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">9\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"8%\">10\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 5\n</td><td> 10\n</td><td> 15\n</td><td> 20\n</td><td> 25\n</td><td> 30\n</td><td> 35\n</td><td> 40\n</td><td> 45\n</td><td> 50\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">X*\n</td><td> 105-246\n</td><td> 193-450\n</td><td> 281-654\n</td><td> 368-858\n</td><td> 456-1062\n</td><td> 544-1266\n</td><td> 632-1470\n</td><td> 720-1674\n</td><td> 807-1878\n</td><td> 895-2082\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\" width=\"10%\">Mana Cost\n</td><td> 16.1\n</td><td> 22.2\n</td><td> 28.2\n</td><td> 34.3\n</td><td> 40.4\n</td><td> 46.5\n</td><td> 52.5\n</td><td> 58.6\n</td><td> 64.7\n</td><td> 70.8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Upgrade Cost\n</td><td> 5568\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td><td> --\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"11\"> \n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Skill Level\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">11\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">12\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">13\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">14\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">15\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">16\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">17\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">18\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">19\n</td><td style=\"background:#9999FF\">20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background:#9999FF\">Req Char Lvl\n</td><td> 55\n</td><td> 60\n</td><td> 65\n</td><td> 70\n</td><td> 75\n</td><td> 80\n</td><td> 85\n</td><td> 90\n</td><td> 95\n</td><